{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleepy sister's friend is a naughty touching game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player, a brother, starts touching his sister's friend while her friend is sleeping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to clear so that you can immerse yourself in touching, but you need to play so that your sister's friend does not wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving is automatic, and there is no penalty for game over, so you can immerse yourself in the game without fear of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All actions can be performed with a single mouse click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rub and lick by selecting the rub button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep rubbing her so as not to wake her up, and new rubbing methods will be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you will be able to remove her clothes and underwear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one stage. The ending is unlocked by increasing the parameters. The ending sex is consensual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of the game is to secretly touch a sleeping woman rather than forcibly touching her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The English is machine translated.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706440?t=1748502087","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706440/7cad34eff5588a74d1fb07ebccf1abd59a31a63b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748502087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706440/3ddcfcb730916ac56b7124afe63f4ef84b978457/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748502087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706440/3ddcfcb730916ac56b7124afe63f4ef84b978457/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748502087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game in general contains nudity, sexual descriptions, and sexually explicit descriptions of women.\r\nSexually violent expressions: removing a sleeping woman's clothes and underwear, touching and licking her breasts, playing with her genitals, and inserting fingers into her genitals without her consent.\r\nKissing a sleeping woman without consent.\r\nSex is consensual."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleepy sister's friend is a naughty touching game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player, a brother, starts touching his sister's friend while her friend is sleeping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to clear so that you can immerse yourself in touching, but you need to play so that your sister's friend does not wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving is automatic, and there is no penalty for game over, so you can immerse yourself in the game without fear of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All actions can be performed with a single mouse click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rub and lick by selecting the rub button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep rubbing her so as not to wake her up, and new rubbing methods will be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you will be able to remove her clothes and underwear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one stage. The ending is unlocked by increasing the parameters. The ending sex is consensual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of the game is to secretly touch a sleeping woman rather than forcibly touching her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The English is machine translated.</p>","developers":["Uzura Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706440/68dc1a088f1dbf86c8f4fcc4eed7c8d25e7b3e81/header.jpg?t=1748502087","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<